				""
				"&6How: &rFind a research outpost (under an Ancient City, beside a Jungle Temple, deep in a cave, in the Nether, rarely as a fenced station on flat land or as a drilling rig over deep ocean), pull the power lever, wait for the warnings to end and press the red button."
